  "title": "Candy Bar Pie II",
  "description": "Candy bar pieces, cream cheese, sour cream and peanut butter make up the filling for this rich, delicious pie. And after this sweet concoction is baked, the pie is then smothered in chocolate cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Vickie"
  ],
